WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:03,490
Didn’t you just say you could leave?

2
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:06,810
I’m tired from walking, so I don’t want to hug you.

3
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:08,810
After eating so much, I need to digest it

4
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:21,430
Less than twenty days

5
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:22,430
Slow down

6
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:24,430
I’m taking you to pick fruits today

7
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:25,430
No one will rob you

8
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:26,430
Come and try it first

9
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:31,860
This tastes really good

10
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,860
Can you sell the whole frame here?

11
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,860
You can order seasonal fruits.

12
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:37,860
Pack the truck together in the afternoon

13
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,860
Lychee Cherry Sheep Eyebrow Peach

14
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,860
Grapes Watermelon Cantaloupe

15
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:44,140
every kind of time

16
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:46,140
In addition, fruit tree seedlings and grape seedlings

17
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,140
Give me a hundred pills each

18
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:50,070
There are a few more types of vehicles

19
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:52,070
So many fruit seedlings are needed

20
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:54,070
I have a piece of land at home and I’m going to plant it slowly.
